<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Your account has been updated</title>
    {{ template "_styles" }}
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Hey there! 👋</h1>
      <p>
        Just a quick heads-up — your password was successfully updated. If you made this change, you're all set!
      </p>
      <p>If this wasn't you, please reset your password immediately or contact support for help.</p>
      <p>Cheers,<br />Cameron</p>
      <div class="footer">
        <p>Need help? Reach us at <a href="mailto:{{ SupportEmail }}">{{ SupportEmail }}</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
